<opentools>
You have direct access to these tools. Call them using tool_calls in your response:

[
  {
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
      "name": "Read",
      "description": "Read file contents. Safe tool, auto-executes.",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "file_path": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "file_path"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
      "name": "Write",
